  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DAARTT - Equitable Access to Quality Eucation in Faryab Province - Cont.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will adress the problems and needs of inadequate access to education in Faryab province, through the following main three interventions: 1. Construction of school buildings and other structures 2. Measures to improve the quality of education 3. Mobilization of local communities for education. The planned effect for the target group of the project is to increase school attendance, in particular among girls.</narrative>
  </description>
